"""Visual and personality design for all 100 characters (docs/ART_STYLE.md section 5).

Each entry: personality, outfit, personal colour (the third colour after the family's body and
accent colours in Config/Art.FamilyColors), weapon, silhouette (the one shape that must read at
48 px). `python sim/roster.py looks` writes these into Config/Characters.luau (`look`) and
art/characters/PROMPTS.md.

Rules: every design starts from this brief, never from a reference character. No costumes,
hair, emblems or colourways of existing characters: no cloud-pattern cloaks, blindfolds or
bandaged eyes, straw hats, orange jumpsuits, forehead protectors or face masks over the nose.
"""

